WEBVTT

01:19:45.000 --> 01:19:46.999
It was a masterpiece. But here’s what I’m thinking.

01:19:47.000 --> 01:19:47.999
Exactly.

01:19:48.000 --> 01:19:49.999
Looking back at a page like this,

01:19:50.000 --> 01:19:51.999
I really did love you so much.

01:19:52.000 --> 01:19:53.999
I’m suffering from this love.

01:19:54.000 --> 01:19:55.999
Oh no!

01:19:56.000 --> 01:19:57.999
PLLI has committed far too many crimes.

01:19:58.000 --> 01:19:59.999
And so have I.

01:20:00.000 --> 01:20:01.999
The crime of loving you too much.

01:20:02.000 --> 01:20:04.999
I shouldn’t be doing this...

01:20:05.000 --> 01:20:07.999
[Hamin and Yejun perform “Love Sick”]

01:20:08.000 --> 01:20:09.999
Why are you kneeling?

01:20:10.000 --> 01:20:11.999
How dare you love PLLI?

01:20:12.000 --> 01:20:12.999
You scoundrel!

01:20:13.000 --> 01:20:14.999
You scoundrel!

01:20:15.000 --> 01:20:17.999
Execute him at once!

01:20:18.000 --> 01:20:18.999
Block him?

01:20:19.000 --> 01:20:19.999
- Ex... execute him!
- Execute him!

01:20:20.000 --> 01:20:22.999
W-Wait!

01:20:23.000 --> 01:21:34.999
[Hamin and Yejun perform “Love Sick”]

01:21:35.000 --> 01:21:36.999
This is really exhausting.

01:21:37.000 --> 01:21:38.999
Hamin, this is your fault.

01:21:39.000 --> 01:21:40.999
It’s your fault.

01:21:41.000 --> 01:21:43.999
Your crime is loving PLLI.

01:21:44.000 --> 01:21:45.999
You may leave now.

01:21:46.000 --> 01:22:01.999
[Hamin and Yejun perform “Love Sick”]

01:22:02.000 --> 01:22:02.999
What did you say?

01:22:03.000 --> 01:22:44.999
[Hamin and Yejun perform “Love Sick”]

01:22:45.000 --> 01:22:45.999
You fool.

01:22:46.000 --> 01:22:46.999
You hopeless fool.

01:22:47.000 --> 01:22:51.999
[Hamin and Yejun perform “Love Sick”]

01:22:52.000 --> 01:22:54.999
Let’s go.

01:22:55.000 --> 01:22:55.999
You hopeless fool.

01:22:56.000 --> 01:22:56.999
What’s wrong with you?

01:22:57.000 --> 01:23:05.999
[Hamin and Yejun perform “Love Sick”]

01:23:06.000 --> 01:23:07.999
Dudu.

01:23:08.000 --> 01:23:08.999
Let’s go, Dudu!

01:23:09.000 --> 01:23:12.999
[Hamin and Yejun perform “Love Sick”]

01:23:13.000 --> 01:23:16.999
Dudu.

01:23:17.000 --> 01:23:19.999
Dudu.

01:23:20.000 --> 01:23:22.999
Dudu, no!

01:23:23.000 --> 01:23:24.999
Stop him! Stop him! Stop him!
Stop him! Stop him!

01:23:25.000 --> 01:24:07.999
[Hamin and Yejun perform “Love Sick”]

01:24:08.000 --> 01:24:11.999
That was “Love Sick.”

01:24:12.000 --> 01:24:14.999
Dudu really suffered from love today.

01:24:15.000 --> 01:24:15.999
Yes, he really did.

01:24:16.000 --> 01:24:19.999
- So Yejun was the one truly lovesick.
- I’m so, so lovesick.

01:24:20.000 --> 01:24:22.999
Down with a fever of love.

01:24:23.000 --> 01:24:23.999
- That’s right.
- I nearly died laughing.

01:24:24.000 --> 01:24:24.999
PLLI, this is how much I love you.

01:24:25.000 --> 01:24:25.999
Seriously.
